1. Box<[u8; 64]>, in words
   1   (Box<[u8]> is 2: the length 64 is in the type, not in the pointer)

2. Option<Rc<str>>, in words
   2   (Rc<str> alone is 2: None costs nothing, since an Rc is never null)

3. let mut a = Rc::new(1); let b = Rc::clone(&a); drop(b); Rc::get_mut(&mut a)?
   Some(1)   (the count is back to 1, so a is unique again)
